      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The analytic and arithmetic representations meet at multiplicative coincidence. Positivity permits a lossy but certified projection onto that coincidence set, while the earlier compression lemmas ensure the projection still carries essentially all of the designed GCD mass.",
