    {
      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_4091383c59f92e00e72891409c5750281f3f5613c50e8e91ba42778ebe3cab07",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The weighted GCD kernel and its prime-factorized divisor functional design a multiplicative correlation; quotient-scale clustering transports the associated square-weight mass into a cardinality-bounded resonator, and positivity in the Fourier-expanded numerator selects near ratios from which exact relations mk=n recover the GCD gain in a smoothed zeta moment.",
